                                "example_id": "79751a86-75f0-4a36-a6b8-ef5847fd1c87",
                                "sense_id": "9293a530-11dd-311e-9eb5-4c1b8533f996",
                                "text": "It seemed to them the ideal place for those confidential mid-morning potations and games of pool for which the Foreign Office had invented the phrase “elevenses”, after the hour of the morning when one feels one most needs a short swift drink, or a long “unwinder”, to use slang."
