                                "sense_id": "9293a530-11dd-311e-9eb5-4c1b8533f996",
                                "text": "2010, William Campbell, Apotheosis, Glyd-Evans Press, p. 137,\nIn contrast to the overwhelming sweetness, the cool drink is bitter like coffee, but with a strong bite of alcohol. One sip and I hand it back. Not the time for that sort of unwinder."
